      "current_summary": "Get a link to a Adyen-hosted onboarding page",
      "current_description": "Returns a link to an Adyen-hosted onboarding page (HOP) that you can send to your account holder. For more information on how to use HOP, refer to [Hosted onboarding](https://docs.adyen.com/classic-platforms/onboard-users/hosted-onboarding-page).",
